            "review_title": "Review at THE SQUARE",
            "review_text": "Holja\nLondon, United Kingdom200 contributions\n1\nPoor\nJun 2022 • Family\nShocker really. We are here two nights. The first was ok but food took 60mins to come. The Thai green curry was earful but other dishes pretty good. \n\nThe next visit…. We decided to play safe and three of the four of us asked for the same dish that looked so good the previous night… after 30mins they realised they only had two chicken breasts. \n\nAfter 45 mins they served the first dish, then 60mins served the other two. \n\nMeanwhile I left as could not wait another hour for mine to turn up.\nRead more\nWritten June 28, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
