            "review_text": "Maggie O\nParis, France52 contributions\n0\nFab food and service\nMar 2017 • Family\nWe were walking past the Novotel at Halong Bay and decided to stop at Square Restaurant for lunch. The food quality was really good, all three of us enjoyed our meal greatly. It wasn't cheap but it wasn't overly expensive for the quality either. We were given free fries with our food. The desserts were excellent also. Had we had more time in Halong Bay we would have eaten there again. It was around 2.30pm and no one else was in the restaurant so it was great that they were happy to cook just for us. The service was outstanding.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 18, 2017",
